OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 veteran 'feels still 50' on
OL,4,A100th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two veteran who is
OL,7,Fcelebrating his 100th birthday on
OL,8,FThursday says he is feeling well and
OL,9,F"I'm putting my name down for another
OL,10,F20 years".
OL,12,FAlbert Malin served on the gruelling
OL,13,FArctic convoys during the conflict as
OL,14,Fan able seaman, on HMS Oxlip.
OL,16,FDespite nearly freezing to death on
OL,17,Fmany occasions, he had since lived a
OL,18,Fhealthy life ` apart from two new hips
OL,19,Fand still lives independently.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
