OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 veteran 'feels still 50' on
OL,4,A100th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm 100, and I feel healthy and well,"
OL,7,Fhe said, adding: "I'm just a little bit
OL,8,Fslower. In my own mind I'm still in my
OL,9,F50s."
